# The PGP *public* key is published on purpose and is linked from /about.
# Keep it tracked. Do not add *.asc or *key* above, both would swallow it.
!static/pubkey.asc

# Timestamped screenshots dropped into static/ are scratch captures from other
# research. Anything in static/ is published verbatim, so keep them out.
/static/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]_*.png
